+The compiler reported non-exhaustive-match warnings in unused supplied helpers
+mapStrVS, floorFI, toF, ceilF, joinCodes, and valSeqAt, plus four unused-variable
+warnings in strLt. It completed successfully.
+
+CONCRETE EXECUTION COMMAND:
+krun smoke.mpy --definition audit-runtime-kompiled
+WORKDIR: /tmp/audit-work/147-clean-rebuild
+EXIT STATUS: 0
+RELEVANT OUTPUT:
+<k> .K </k>
+scope 0 included:
+  "result_1" |-> 0
+  "result_5" |-> 1
+  "result_10" |-> 36
+<scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>
+<heap> .Map </heap>
+<heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>
+<stack> .List </stack>
+<ret> noRet </ret>
