+SCRATCH PREPARATION:
+Created /tmp/audit-work/147-clean-rebuild from candidate source artifacts only.
+No candidate-provided compiled definition or cache was copied into this clean
+directory. The source tree contained reference-semantics/, solution.py,
+solution.mpy, verification.k, spec.k, smoke.py, smoke.mpy, and mutation source.
+
+TOOLCHAIN COMMAND:
+command -v kompile && command -v krun && command -v kprove &&
+kompile --version && kprove --version
+EXIT STATUS: 0
+RELEVANT OUTPUT:
+/usr/bin/kompile
+/usr/bin/krun
+/usr/bin/kprove
+K version: v7.1.293
+K version: v7.1.293
+
+CONCRETE BUILD COMMAND:
+kompile reference-semantics/semantics.k \
+  --backend llvm \
+  --main-module MPY-KRUN \
+  --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX \
+  --output-definition audit-runtime-kompiled
+WORKDIR: /tmp/audit-work/147-clean-rebuild
+EXIT STATUS: 0
+RELEVANT OUTPUT:
+The compiler reported non-exhaustive-match warnings in unused supplied helpers
+mapStrVS, floorFI, toF, ceilF, joinCodes, and valSeqAt, plus four unused-variable
