+GENERATION EVIDENCE OK 6292681fe6264a6fd8417584e08b815511477729796d2be6748ee3855b6fff66 /generation-evidence/codex-output.log
+GENERATION EVIDENCE OK 61a3baf27d9e707c673337a266e8df9a331001454dbb0bae259bbfb8642a6e4b /generation-evidence/codex-trace/2026/07/25/rollout-2026-07-25T03-25-48-019f9861-6a39-7c30-801d-5d8a06184f48.jsonl
+GENERATION EVIDENCE OK c5f7af5f994f1d98d2cb3ab967f88f74a437a6548277cceaf24481aba1cf31e5 /generation-evidence/prompt.txt
+GENERATION EVIDENCE OK 79b87eabc38674c8968fc73ae9366cbd6977c71ff646c2fa1c6acbdf0f3ccf7f /generation-evidence/runtime-metrics.json
+GENERATION EVIDENCE OK d58c498613e054247a4a3dd845572f5e97b7c50cdc03f7b2ba1d680b25a13792 /generation-evidence/usage.json
+TRACE TREE OK regular_files=1
+CANDIDATE REQUIRED PROOF ARTIFACTS OK
+SUPPLIED SEMANTICS TREE OK entries=25 recursive path/type/byte identity
+PROMPT AND TRANSLATOR OK byte-identical to trusted mounts
+INTEGRITY CHECK PASS
+
+INDEPENDENT REVIEWER TREE DIGEST COMMAND:
+For each sorted entry, hash:
+  type-byte NUL relative-path NUL eight-byte-content-length file-content
+Directories carry zero content; symlinks would carry their target.
+EXIT STATUS: 0
+RESULTS:
+/candidate
+  reviewer_tree_sha256=0d16674580eafb570b79e71839c2754b0ea27584f4605ecb1fcca306ea6dff97
+  files=774 bytes=81272567 symlinks=0
+/reference/reference-semantics
+  reviewer_tree_sha256=e7e97b99fb2596d45b95c28ee873b7d18ed57e631865ac0a9128b07a4fa1e308
+  files=24 bytes=117274 symlinks=0
+/generation-evidence/codex-trace
+  reviewer_tree_sha256=4392bb4c5dc4cec86858227b403ee92d51acc9bfe18d3f1440ea924580058a18
+  files=1 bytes=500627 symlinks=0
+
+The launcher does not declare the serialization algorithm used for its aggregate
+tree digests, so these reviewer digests are intentionally not compared as bare
+strings with those aggregate fields. File hashes declared by the launcher were
+all reproduced exactly; the supplied semantics was additionally checked by
